  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "After simple interest for two months at \\(5\\%\\) per annum was credited, a Boy Scout Troop had a total of \\(\\$255.31\\) in the Council Treasury. The interest credited was a number of dollars plus the following number of cents:",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(11\\)"
    },
